  "body": "### What is the issue with the Console Standard?\n\nThe returned value types of the three return points of Logger() at https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#logger are not consistent but should be. Further, since Formatter(x) returns x when the size of x is one, steps 2, 3, and 4 can be eliminated.",
